Package: lumo-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 breeze-gtk-theme,
 fonts-roboto-unhinted,
 kwin-common,
 plasma-desktop,
 plasma-workspace,
 qml6-module-org-kde-desktop,
 qml6-module-org-kde-kirigami,
 qml6-module-qtquick-effects,
 qml6-module-qt-labs-folderlistmodel,
 qml6-module-qtquick-layouts,
 qml6-module-qtquick-shapes,
 qml6-module-qtquick-templates,
 qt-style-kvantum
Recommends:
 plymouth,
 plymouth-label
Description: Lumo desktop appearance and shell
 This package carries the Lumo desktop: a complete Material 3 design
 for Plasma, generated from one seed colour.
 .
  * the Lumo Dark and Light colour schemes and the Lumo Plasma theme,
    drawn from the same Material 3 palette;
  * the Lumo icon theme, drawn from Material Symbols Rounded;
  * Lumo Launcher, an application menu with search, and Lumo Quick
    Settings, the status area and the shade pulled up from the panel;
  * Lumo Shapes, a live wallpaper of Material 3 Expressive shapes;
  * the Lumo Kvantum theme, which gives every Qt widget -- menus,
    buttons, fields, lists -- the same Material shapes and palette;
  * a Qt Quick Controls style for System Settings and other QML applications,
    and the Lumo window decoration;
  * the splash and the look-and-feel package that lays out the floating
    panel and selects all of the above.
 .
 It sets that look-and-feel as the system-wide default, so a freshly
 created account starts with the Lumo desktop instead of the Plasma one.

Package: lumo-calamares
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 calamares (>= 3.3.14-1lumo2),
 lumo-desktop (= ${source:Version}),
 pkexec,
 polkitd
Description: Lumo installer configuration
 This package configures Calamares to install Lumo from the live image
 onto a disk: the module sequence, the target clean-up of live-only settings
 and the Lumo installer branding.
 .
 The installer removes this package while installing, which leaves Calamares
 without a configuration on the installed system.
